    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Brain Powerd",
        "jpn": "ブレンパワード"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Orphan, a long-hidden alien spaceship, is rising from the ocean depths, causing floods and earthquakes all over Earth. The earthquakes release two types of \"Antibodies\" (robotic organisms); the brutish Grand Chers and the intelligent Brain Powerd. Now, a group of Orphan supporters, known as Reclaimers, must battle the U.N.'s Novis Noah using these Antibodies for the fate of the world. In the center of this are Hime and Yuu, two teens trying to unravel the true purpose of Orphan and Brain Powerd.",
        "jpn": "主人公は、両親を自ら捨てた伊佐未勇と、幼い頃に両親を亡くしたブレンパワードのパイロット宇都宮比瑪。時は近未来、生体エネルギーを吸い取り宇宙へ浮上しようとする謎の遺跡「オルファン」を止めるため、国連は「ブレンパワード」を使う一方、「リクレイマー」となり、共に宇宙へ旅立とうとする…"
    },
    "Aliases": [],
    "Modified": "2026-01-11",
    "Seasons": {
        "1": {
            "ID": "2893",
            "URL": "https://thetvdb.com/series/brain-powerd/seasons/official/1",
            "Titles": {
                "eng": null,
                "jpn": null
